	Run this on your finder account(s). In every server it:
	  1. scans every base for brainrots and works out their real M/s
	  2. posts anything above your minimum to your feed (free Firebase database) with the JobId,
	     and to your Discord webhook with the brainrot's picture from the wiki
	  3. leaves for a fresh server straight away and does it again (re-runs itself after teleport)

	Infin AJ users with the same FEED URL get each find as a log they can join.

	To keep hopping, the script has to re-run after each teleport. Either:
	  • save this file as  workspace/InfinFinder.lua  in your executor folder, or
	  • host it and put  loadstring(game:HttpGet("your raw url"))()  in LOADER below
]]

